{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play arcade games in large or mini screen mode and enjoy the sight of sea creatures.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Included games</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Bricks Breaker</strong>: Break bricks with a ball and reach level 20. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Pong Velocity</strong>: Defeat the computer even as the ball speeds up. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Tetrominos</strong>: Arrange geometric shapes to clear lines. How far can you go? </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Snake</strong>: The classic snake game. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Pong Twist</strong>: Overcome challenges in at least five levels to reach the final stage and face the boss.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ski</strong>: Go as far as possible while avoiding being eaten by a yeti.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mental Penalty</strong>: Score goals while solving math challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The fish are watching you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930020/extras/pong_twist_level7.gif?t=1742834154\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Pong winner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2930020/634936d465b22b0be5ddcaa3afe7626ec5371417.jpg"},{"name":"Tetrominos winner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2930020/cbd8ad859e30c5beb4dbe03ca81bbcb89575d346.jpg"},{"name":"Pong Twist winner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2930020/8a8d1d108b8ba2f0f8a4af73f3cda0da167d4a66.jpg"},{"name":"Bricks Breaker winner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2930020/1e61d3534e1d67c97c7d905d19b3fec4e77d